WEBVTT

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:11.400
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:13.740
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:17.370
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.870
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.460
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.090
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.640
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:40.350
by ridding you...

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:43.520
...of your other love?

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.110
At sunset,

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:50.610
when the children go home,

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:54.610
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:58.450
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:00.540
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.330
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:09.960
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.800
In a city without light,

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.680
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:19.100
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.390
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:24.890
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:35.690
I'm Kurata Sana, a 6th grader
and TV personality.

00:01:35.690 --> 00:01:38.030
My beloved Mama is a novelist.

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:40.030
My handsome manager, Rei-kun.

00:01:40.030 --> 00:01:43.700
Hayama Akito, my natural enemy
and good friend.

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:46.370
Gomi Shinichi, one of Hayama's followers-

00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:50.040
Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey! Don't skip
over Babbit's introduction!

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:55.040
Oh, yeah, this guy is awful. Thanks to him,
the story turned serious, ma'am.

00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:58.120
Let's first watch this replay film
from last week.

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:07.720
I- it's Hayama-san's fault.

00:02:07.720 --> 00:02:12.060
"My Shinichi-chan is going to
test for Kaimei Middle School."

00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:15.400
You spread it around to everyone!

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:18.310
I'm not about to go to any school
where he is!

00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:23.310
"Gomi-kun, Gomi-kun,
Where Are You Going?"

00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:26.740
I'm home.

00:02:26.740 --> 00:02:31.740
Welcome home, Shinichi-san. You can
stay home from school starting tomorrow.

00:02:32.680 --> 00:02:36.010
There will be a private tutor
coming to our home instead.

00:02:36.020 --> 00:02:40.020
He's the same excellent tutor
that taught your brother.

00:02:40.020 --> 00:02:44.020
He'll be coming starting tomorrow.
Is that clear, Shinichi-san?

00:02:44.020 --> 00:02:45.230
Yes.

00:02:48.030 --> 00:02:52.030
Don't go deciding... don't go deciding things
for me without asking me, you damn hag!

00:02:55.030 --> 00:02:57.740
Damn! It hurts!

00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:09.050
Sorry to butt in while you're being serious,
but your dad brought home sushi.

00:03:09.050 --> 00:03:10.120
Sushi!?

00:03:12.720 --> 00:03:14.790
There must have been...

00:03:14.790 --> 00:03:17.600
there must have been something
that happened between those two.

00:03:19.730 --> 00:03:21.390
Did something happen?

00:03:21.390 --> 00:03:22.390
Not really.

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:25.400
There must have been
something that happened!

00:03:25.400 --> 00:03:27.400
Something happened!
Something happened, I tell you!

00:03:27.400 --> 00:03:29.170
I tell you, I tell you!
Something happened!

00:03:29.170 --> 00:03:31.240
Something something something
happened happened happened!

00:03:33.670 --> 00:03:35.670
♪ Boys have roads that they go down, ♪

00:03:35.680 --> 00:03:37.680
♪ and girls have roads that they go down. ♪

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:39.680
♪ Hayama's road is winding and strays, ♪

00:03:39.680 --> 00:03:42.010
♪ and if you call to him
with a kind voice... ♪

00:03:42.020 --> 00:03:44.680
"Not really. None of your business."

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:46.690
♪ You can't say that! You can't
say that! Not without sauce! ♪

00:03:46.690 --> 00:03:48.690
♪ That's too much for Mari-chan,
hideous to Hide-chan! ♪

00:03:48.690 --> 00:03:50.690
Shut up!!

00:03:50.690 --> 00:03:53.690
Mama is working! I'm writing a manuscript!

00:03:53.690 --> 00:03:54.860
And what are you doing!?

00:03:54.860 --> 00:03:57.030
Are you amusing yourself by yelling
all night and bothering me!?

00:03:57.030 --> 00:04:02.030
Mama is trying this... this... this hard
to work, and you're bothering me!

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:07.040
Sagami-kun! You say something to her, too!

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:11.380
It's starting! "Late-Night Chaos Theater,"
episode 1!

00:04:11.380 --> 00:04:12.710
Ah, they're airing it tonight?

00:04:12.710 --> 00:04:15.710
We don't have a video deck, so let's
watch it closely now, with our naked eyes.

00:04:15.720 --> 00:04:17.980
--♪ Our naked-naked eyes-eyes, ♪

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:19.380
--♪ naked eyes-eyes... ♪

00:04:19.390 --> 00:04:21.390
Ka-boom!!

00:04:21.390 --> 00:04:23.370
--♪ ...naked eyes! ♪

00:04:26.060 --> 00:04:27.990
--If you want to make noise,
make it out there!
--Aah! Please stop! Aah!

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:29.060
--If you want to make noise,
make it out there!
--Asako, I love you! Aah!

00:04:29.060 --> 00:04:31.660
H- hold on, Mama, this is a bit much...

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:33.570
So what!? Are you saying
that Mama trying to work

00:04:33.570 --> 00:04:36.000
is more to blame
than you guys making noise!?

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:41.000
N-no, the one to blame is... the one to
blame is... that's right! It's Hayama!

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:43.010
If we go back to the start,
this is all Hayama's fault!

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:44.340
It's not disgusting.

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:46.350
It's not, huh? That's nice.

00:04:46.350 --> 00:04:49.680
No, don't just say "that's nice," Dad!

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:51.680
Don't you think Akito is acting weird?

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:54.350
Whatever, just hurry and eat your sushi!

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:57.360
Akito, are you being weird?

00:04:57.360 --> 00:04:58.360
Not really.

00:04:58.360 --> 00:04:59.020
See?

00:04:59.030 --> 00:05:01.690
--He is being weird! Weird! Weird, I say!
--Whatever, just hurry and eat your sushi!

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:04.500
Why are you eating sushi
with your face covered, huh?

00:05:06.370 --> 00:05:08.370
You don't have to act so surprised.

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:10.370
Of course I'm surprised!
I'm shocked and stunned!

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:11.970
My brother is eating sushi
with his face covered,

00:05:11.970 --> 00:05:13.710
and suddenly, he starts to vibrate!

00:05:13.710 --> 00:05:15.710
Any Japanese person
would be bowled over!

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:19.040
"Kitchen garbage, construction worker,
Amitabha, seaweed."

00:05:19.050 --> 00:05:21.380
What are you trying to tell me, Kurata?

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:23.950
--Now he's saying things that
don't make any sense!
--Kitchen garbage, construction worker,

00:05:23.950 --> 00:05:25.050
--That's positively, positively weird!
--Amitabha, seaweed...

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:27.590
--No, no, no! Not only does he
--Aren't you going to eat your sushi?

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:29.760
--cover his face while eating sushi,
--No matter how much of it I eat...

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:30.820
--and then start to vibrate,
--Ah, it's still delicious.

00:05:30.820 --> 00:05:32.790
--but now he's blurting out
the weirdest things!
--Ah, it's still delicious.

00:05:32.790 --> 00:05:34.330
I've got to go tell the Hashimotos
across the street!

00:05:34.330 --> 00:05:36.660
Ah, this is such a fine household.

00:05:36.660 --> 00:05:40.000
Oh, yeah, when you decipher it...

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:44.190
"What happened between you and Gomi?"

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:42.600
...that's what it says.

00:05:44.340 --> 00:05:46.720
Sana-chan, we watched it!

00:05:48.010 --> 00:05:50.340
You did, huh? You watched it?
Watched what?

00:05:50.340 --> 00:05:53.010
Last night's "Late-Night Chaos Theater."

00:05:53.010 --> 00:05:54.510
--I'm not sure how to say this,
--When it comes to money...

00:05:54.510 --> 00:05:56.180
--but I got the feel of your
Gekidan Komawari spirit.
--That's right, what of it?

00:05:56.180 --> 00:05:58.350
Uh-huh! You stood out even
more than the main characters!

00:05:58.350 --> 00:06:00.690
--Oh, did you notice the slight
pratfall I did at the end?
--Just a minute.

00:06:00.690 --> 00:06:02.350
--Mm-hmm.
--For you, I would even...

00:06:02.360 --> 00:06:04.690
Say, what did you think of Take-chan?

00:06:04.690 --> 00:06:06.020
Take-chan?

00:06:06.030 --> 00:06:10.360
Gojo Takeshi, so "Take-chan."
He was pretty handsome, huh?

00:06:10.360 --> 00:06:12.030
S- sure he was...

00:06:12.030 --> 00:06:14.730
Say, it's been in
the sports papers and stuff,

00:06:14.730 --> 00:06:17.700
but Sana-chan, do you really
find that old guy...

00:06:17.700 --> 00:06:18.700
I love him.

00:06:18.710 --> 00:06:20.040
--Urgh!

00:06:20.040 --> 00:06:21.770
--Ew, ugh! Ew, ugh! Ew, ugh!
--He's fairly mischievous,

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:24.240
--Ew, ugh! Ew, ugh! Ew, ugh!
--and just a little bit timid...

00:06:24.240 --> 00:06:26.040
that's what's so nice about him.

00:06:26.050 --> 00:06:30.520
Sana-chan, way to go!!

00:06:31.650 --> 00:06:35.650
That's right! If you love him, you should
be able to say you love him, huh?

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:37.660
Hisae-chan...

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:39.990
By any chance?

00:06:39.990 --> 00:06:42.660
It's nothing, really! Nothing!

00:06:42.660 --> 00:06:43.660
Wait up!

00:06:43.660 --> 00:06:45.660
You like him, too?

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:47.000
What!? What!? What!?

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:49.210
How do you do that!?

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:56.010
Ow!

00:06:56.010 --> 00:06:57.010
Hayama?

00:06:57.010 --> 00:06:59.680
Sorry, sorry.

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:02.350
What happened to your face?

00:07:02.350 --> 00:07:03.660
Nothing.

00:07:06.520 --> 00:07:07.350
"Naru-head!!"

00:07:07.350 --> 00:07:08.690
Shinichi-kun...

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:10.690
Can't you even solve those problems?

00:07:10.690 --> 00:07:15.030
I don't get it! Tell me
how to do it, step-by-step.

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:16.700
Come in.

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:18.700
Are you getting anywhere, Sensei?

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:20.030
Thank you so much.

00:07:20.030 --> 00:07:22.700
Looks like you're making progress,
huh Shinichi-san?

00:07:22.700 --> 00:07:24.370
Yes.

00:07:24.370 --> 00:07:25.800
That's right.

00:07:25.810 --> 00:07:29.040
I understand that Kaimei Middle School's
assistant principal...

00:07:29.040 --> 00:07:31.980
...was once Shinichi-kun's
father's homeroom teacher.

00:07:31.980 --> 00:07:32.980
Yes.

00:07:32.980 --> 00:07:36.310
But an entrance exam is an entrance exam.
They won't let him in for nothing,

00:07:36.320 --> 00:07:39.650
so Shinichi-san will have
to study hard for us.

00:07:39.650 --> 00:07:42.900
Well, continue, if you please.

00:07:45.660 --> 00:07:48.990
What made you want to test
for Kaimei Middle?

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:51.660
I'm going to tell you this flat-out-

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:54.470
If you can't even solve those problems,

00:07:54.470 --> 00:07:57.670
it'll be impossible for you
to get into Kaimei Middle.

00:07:57.670 --> 00:08:01.670
What will you do once you test
for Kaimei Middle and fail?

00:08:01.670 --> 00:08:06.340
If you can't go back to Jinbo Middle,
what exactly do you plan to do?

00:08:06.350 --> 00:08:09.790
Don't you think Jinbo Middle
would be better for you?

00:08:19.360 --> 00:08:21.030
I heard they're raising the sales tax.

00:08:21.030 --> 00:08:23.510
What will we ever do?

00:08:24.700 --> 00:08:27.030
You guys in 6th grade?

00:08:27.030 --> 00:08:28.370
Y- yes.

00:08:28.370 --> 00:08:30.040
Is Gomi-kun here?

00:08:30.040 --> 00:08:32.640
You know who Gomi-kun is, right?

00:08:32.640 --> 00:08:34.310
H- he's not here today.

00:08:34.310 --> 00:08:36.150
How come?

00:08:42.150 --> 00:08:45.470
"Gomi is all alone"

00:08:42.320 --> 00:08:45.490
Being all alone is... no fun!

00:08:51.660 --> 00:08:54.700
Aw, I'm bored.

00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:00.640
Seriously?

00:09:07.340 --> 00:09:09.620
Heh heh, those were the days.

00:09:11.340 --> 00:09:13.650
Tch, I'm short.

00:09:21.020 --> 00:09:24.190
Ah! You're thinking of doing
something shameful, aren't you?

00:09:24.190 --> 00:09:25.930
Huh? Huh? Huh? Huh?

00:09:29.360 --> 00:09:32.830
Hey! That's shoplifting!

00:09:37.970 --> 00:09:39.750
What are you doing?

00:09:42.980 --> 00:09:45.620
Hey! Hold it, you!

00:09:50.320 --> 00:09:52.060
Gomi!?

00:09:56.320 --> 00:09:58.500
What are you doing?

00:09:59.330 --> 00:10:00.660
Hold it, you!

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:02.330
Yikes!

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:03.330
Hey, you! Hey, you!

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:04.660
What the?

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:06.330
What do you think you're doing!?

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:10.340
You're one incorrigible kid!
Are you still in elementary school?

00:10:10.340 --> 00:10:13.670
Don't you know right from wrong!?

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:17.280
What school do you go to?
Jinbo Elementary? Where do you live?

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:27.350
Dad! Dad!

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:30.290
What's the matter? Want me
to bring home sushi again?

00:10:30.290 --> 00:10:33.070
Akito's been... Akito's been...

00:10:34.290 --> 00:10:36.630
What an alarming situation!

00:10:36.630 --> 00:10:39.300
What's the matter? Has your
makeup collapsed again?

00:10:39.300 --> 00:10:42.910
Hayama Akito has been shoplifting!?

00:10:43.970 --> 00:10:45.070
--We're-

00:10:45.070 --> 00:10:47.480
--Gomi
--ltami
--and Kojima!

00:10:48.460 --> 00:10:54.880
"Babbit's drawing song"

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:51.380
Rice cake, bump, bump,
line, line, triangle,

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:53.380
raindrop with a heart in it,
draw the wings,

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:54.880
and it's Babbit!

00:10:55.460 --> 00:10:57.380
Gossip about Hayama!
Gossip about Hayama!

00:10:56.380 --> 00:11:00.890
"Gossip"

00:10:57.380 --> 00:10:59.380
--I heard Hayama-san
was caught shoplifting!
--Have you heard?

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:00.890
--Did you hear about Hayama-san?
--Know what Hayama-san did?

00:11:00.890 --> 00:11:05.180
Akito, your dad hates lies,
exaggerations, and vagueness,

00:11:05.180 --> 00:11:07.390
so I'm going to ask you directly-

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:09.730
Did you shoplift anything?

00:11:09.730 --> 00:11:10.730
No, I didn't.

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:12.400
He says he didn't.

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:15.070
My word! How dare he say that
so brazenly and bald-facedly!

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:19.070
But then, what is a bald face?
What is a brazen? I'm not sure, but ooh!

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:22.070
This could be dangerous, so you good boys
and girls shouldn't try it at home.

00:11:22.070 --> 00:11:23.740
Ah! Babbit's the one who makes the quips!

00:11:23.740 --> 00:11:26.080
Now, listen here, Father!

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:27.410
Yes?

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:31.420
The store owner- who, parenthetically,
has an eyesight of 0.03-

00:11:31.420 --> 00:11:36.420
said that he saw your son shoplifting!

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:38.920
--Aah, this is alarming,
--Whatever you might say,

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:40.760
--alarming, alarming, alarming!
--I didn't do what I didn't do.

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:43.430
Whatever you might say,
he says he didn't do it.

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:48.430
Principal, Hayama-kun has caused some
rather humorless mischief before.

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:52.100
He has even driven me to tears quite a bit.

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:55.110
H- he's driven you
to tears, Mitsuya-sensei!?

00:11:55.110 --> 00:12:01.320
Still, I'm not entirely sure that Hayama-kun
is the kind of boy who would tell a lie.

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:07.450
The fact remains that an incident
of shoplifting did take place!

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:11.250
Principal, dispense a harsh punishment,
if you please!

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:18.800
It'll all turn out-

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:21.130
And let's not have you
smile things away today

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:22.470
by saying "it'll all turn out fine-fine."

00:12:22.470 --> 00:12:25.800
Can't I? But I so much want to!

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:30.470
The man from the store said that he did it,
but Hayama-kun said he didn't do it.

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:34.440
I told you something at our
Guidance session, didn't I?

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:37.770
Once more! If you cause one more incident,

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:42.780
your advancement to Middle School
will be in jeopardy.

00:12:42.780 --> 00:12:45.780
That's ridiculous! Hayama shop-

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:50.790
No! No, he didn't! Akito-kun...
Akito-kun wouldn't do something like that!

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:54.460
That's right. If Tsuyoshi-kun
believes Hayama-kun, then so do I.

00:12:54.460 --> 00:12:56.130
Aya-chan, thank you.

00:12:56.130 --> 00:12:58.790
Because of our love-love power, I believe.

00:13:00.460 --> 00:13:01.760
Shinichi-san...

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:06.140
It's about time you took
a breather and had some lunch.

00:13:06.140 --> 00:13:07.510
S- sure.

00:13:07.510 --> 00:13:11.680
"Pass"

00:13:07.800 --> 00:13:10.470
Today, I made your favorite,
omelet and rice, Shinichi-san.

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:11.680
Thank you.

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:13.480
Shinichi-san, I heard a bit
of a rumor going around...

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:15.140
"Gossip"

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:15.140
Shinichi-san, I heard a bit
of a rumor going around...

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:16.480
W- what?

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:20.480
It seems that there was
some shoplifting committed...

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:24.650
...by that boy Hayama-kun
in your class. How disturbing.

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:30.490
D- don't tell me... Hayama-san...

00:13:30.490 --> 00:13:33.750
They say that Hayama-kun
was a bad kid before this.

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:36.080
As I remember, he doesn't have a mother.

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:39.750
I'm so glad you didn't turn out
like that, Shinichi-san.

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:42.420
Geez, yes I have!

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:46.430
If your mother ever heard that you had
done something like that, Shinichi-san...

00:13:46.430 --> 00:13:49.090
If I had done something like that?

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:52.770
If you had done something like that...

00:13:56.440 --> 00:13:59.100
Mom?

00:13:59.100 --> 00:14:02.980
I'm sorry. I'm disturbing your lunch,
aren't I?

00:14:04.440 --> 00:14:07.450
It's Hayama-san's own fault...

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:12.450
Hayama-san spread it around
about me and Kaimei Middle...

00:14:12.790 --> 00:14:17.460
But if Hayama-san snitches on me
about the shoplifting...

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:20.460
Okay, it's mine!

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:21.460
All right!

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:23.800
Tsubasa-kun, shoot!

00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:25.670
Huh? Gomi?

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:28.800
Y- yo!

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:33.060
--Gossip... gossip... Go! Go!
--Did you hear about
Hayama-san shoplifting?

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:34.100
Yeah, I heard a rumor.

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:36.100
Man, isn't that lame!?

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:38.140
I figured he's the kind of guy
that would pull something,

00:14:38.140 --> 00:14:41.400
but shoplifting water pistols? That's weak.

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:45.440
Never mind that, Gomi, are you
studying for entrance exams?

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:46.400
Yeah.

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:47.610
When I heard from someone in 2nd Class

00:14:47.610 --> 00:14:50.070
that you were testing
for Kaimei Middle, Gomi,

00:14:50.070 --> 00:14:54.120
I thought it was hinky,
malarkey, and Antonio lnoki!

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:57.790
I'll bet- hey! What do you mean,
someone in 2nd Class?

00:14:57.790 --> 00:14:59.420
That shaggy Watanabe kid, in 2nd Class.

00:14:59.420 --> 00:15:02.750
I heard it when he was spreading stuff
around in the hall, like he always does.

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:05.750
What!? You mean, Hayama-san wasn't
the one who told everyone!?

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:08.800
I- I don't know!

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:12.090
Someone of as few words as Hayama-san
wouldn't say anything, about that, right?

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:15.470
What's the matter, Gomi?
You're suddenly so serious...

00:15:15.470 --> 00:15:18.430
It wasn't Hayama-san!

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:23.440
It wasn't Hayama-san... It wasn't
Hayama-san who ratted on me!

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:25.770
Hayama?

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:30.740
Everyone thinks you shoplifted,
but did you really?

00:15:30.740 --> 00:15:32.070
No, I didn't.

00:15:32.070 --> 00:15:37.080
What went on? Tell me plainly
everything that happened, Hayama.

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:40.750
If saying that I didn't do it
doesn't do any good...

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:41.750
...then it's no use.

00:15:41.750 --> 00:15:45.090
Hey, don't tell me it's no use!

00:15:45.090 --> 00:15:48.420
Are you okay with not being
allowed to go to Jinbo Middle?

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:50.760
It's none of your business.

00:15:50.760 --> 00:15:53.760
None of my business!?

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:55.760
Hey, what's with you!?

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:58.430
I'm worried about you!
I'm worried about you!

00:15:58.430 --> 00:16:00.430
We're best friends, right!?
I'm the lead character, right!?

00:16:00.430 --> 00:16:01.770
You've got no reason
to hide anything from-

00:16:01.770 --> 00:16:06.770
Time for the drama taping! Time for the
drama taping! Time for the drama taping!

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:12.780
Oh, no! I have to get to
the studio on my own today!

00:16:13.780 --> 00:16:18.450
Oh, right! Hayama,
I believe you, okay? Bye!

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:19.450
Hayama-san!

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:24.120
Huh? I thought he was just here,
talking to Kurata. Damn!

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:25.960
What is it with everyone?

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:31.380
I... have to tell Hayama-san...

00:16:31.380 --> 00:16:33.090
I have to tell Hayama-san...

00:16:36.970 --> 00:16:41.680
"Gomi Legal Office"

00:16:37.720 --> 00:16:41.680
Yes, one moment please.

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:45.400
You have a telephone call from your son.

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:48.070
What? As busy as I am right now?

00:16:48.070 --> 00:16:52.740
Hello, is that you, Shinichi?
Why are you calling me here?

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:56.070
Hello? Shinichi!? Answer me!

00:16:56.070 --> 00:17:01.080
Hello, Shinichi!? You can hear me,
can't you? Your father is busy.

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:04.080
If you don't want anything,
then I'm hanging up.

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:06.420
You're going to go to Kaimei Middle,
aren't you?

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:10.750
If you had done something like that,
Shinichi-san...

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:13.420
If you have something to say to me,
then do it when I get home.

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:16.090
Dad! I'm sorry!

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:21.100
I'm... I'm... I'm the one who...
I'm the one who...

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:24.690
I'm the one who shoplifted!!

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:41.080
I'd like to make a crack here, but I can't.

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:43.750
Waah! It's starting!

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:48.420
I am truly sorry for the terrible
trouble my son has caused you.

00:17:48.420 --> 00:17:50.090
I'm sorry.

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:53.420
We have already been over to offer
our apologies to the store owner.

00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:55.760
Please raise your head, Gomi-san.

00:17:55.760 --> 00:17:57.760
All the blood will go
to his head, after all.

00:17:57.760 --> 00:17:59.760
No making cracks right now!

00:17:59.760 --> 00:18:02.100
Aw, he got mad at me.

00:18:02.100 --> 00:18:05.770
Akito-kun, I don't know
how to make it up to you.

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:08.480
You stood up for Shinichi
right up to the end,

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:09.770
without ever mentioning his name.

00:18:09.770 --> 00:18:13.110
As his father, it is difficult
for me to face you.

00:18:14.780 --> 00:18:18.110
Um, you should let the tea
cool down a little...

00:18:18.110 --> 00:18:22.780
Shinichi has always been physically weak,
and prone to getting sick,

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:25.450
so in order to afford him a little
latitude in his school life,

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:28.460
we enrolled him into Jinbo Elementary,
with its escalator system.

00:18:28.460 --> 00:18:32.040
But these last few years,
he has become quite healthy.

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:34.550
Both my wife and I became overeager,

00:18:34.550 --> 00:18:36.380
and suggested he sit
for that entrance exam.

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:38.970
We probably shouldn't have done so.

00:18:46.730 --> 00:18:51.400
Don't forget to take that
jacket of yours home tonight.

00:18:51.400 --> 00:18:54.730
H- Hayama-san... I'm...

00:18:54.730 --> 00:18:59.070
I'm sure you must have been quite
concerned about your son, Hayama-san.

00:18:59.070 --> 00:19:01.740
I believed him.

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:08.370
I believed what my son thought
and did. I am his father, after all.

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:16.420
We really are terribly sorry for this.
Good night.

00:19:22.090 --> 00:19:25.890
Are you still mad at Gomi-kun?

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:31.310
I was never mad at him to begin with.

00:19:33.400 --> 00:19:37.780
Dad, I... I...

00:19:41.070 --> 00:19:44.740
I heard that Hayama-kun
is going to Jinbo Middle.

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:47.040
What about you, Shinichi?

00:19:47.080 --> 00:19:48.750
I'm...

00:19:50.370 --> 00:19:53.170
This week's Sana-chan!

00:19:56.420 --> 00:19:59.090
Hey, Sana-chan, I hoid you've
been waiting for five hours.

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:02.090
It shua is rough being an extra, huh?

00:20:02.090 --> 00:20:06.720
Well, just wait patiently. Now then,
my quiz show is just about to start taping...

00:20:06.720 --> 00:20:10.640
Zenjiro-chan, you've got a 100-hour wait.

00:20:12.390 --> 00:20:14.440
We've been waiting for five hours.

00:20:14.440 --> 00:20:16.440
And our line is just...

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:18.110
--"Aah!?"
--"Aah!?"

00:20:18.110 --> 00:20:19.440
...that's all.

00:20:19.440 --> 00:20:21.110
Five-hour wait.

00:20:21.110 --> 00:20:23.070
--This is intolerable!
--This is intolerable!

00:20:23.070 --> 00:20:25.070
♪ !elbarelotni si sihT ♪

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:26.450
--♪ This is intolerable! ♪

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:28.740
--♪ A five-hour wait! ♪
--Their scene has been cut, huh Director?

00:20:28.740 --> 00:20:32.620
--♪A five-hour wait! ♪
--I can't tell them myself.

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:36.380
--!ydnah si sihT

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:38.040
This is handy!

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:40.050
I can also write with it.

00:20:39.050 --> 00:20:40.090
"The next day..."

00:20:41.720 --> 00:20:44.050
Yo, give me some money.

00:20:44.050 --> 00:20:46.390
Gomi-kun has stopped coming to school.

00:20:46.390 --> 00:20:48.390
We're hard up now.

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:50.060
You guys!

00:20:50.060 --> 00:20:52.060
Don't you lay a hand on Hayama-san!

00:20:52.060 --> 00:20:53.390
--What?

00:20:53.390 --> 00:20:56.400
Hayama-san, if you cause
any more trouble,

00:20:56.400 --> 00:21:00.230
you won't be able to go
to Jinbo Middle, right?

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:04.700
Let's both go to
Jinbo Middle together, Hayama-san.

00:21:06.070 --> 00:21:08.990
Why, you! You thinking of
turning your back on us!?

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:15.420
H- Hayama-san, is that?

00:21:15.420 --> 00:21:19.090
For self-defense. You want to use one too?

00:21:19.090 --> 00:21:20.840
Hayama-san!

00:21:23.090 --> 00:21:25.760
Don't you toy with us!

00:21:25.760 --> 00:21:28.090
--Double fire!
--Double fire!

00:21:28.760 --> 00:21:30.100
You bastards! Stop messing with us!

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:33.390
Hey! No fighting!

00:21:37.440 --> 00:21:39.690
W- who was that!?

00:21:42.110 --> 00:21:44.780
I will not allow any alarming situations!

00:21:44.780 --> 00:21:46.450
What was that thing!?

00:21:46.450 --> 00:21:47.780
Help!

00:21:47.780 --> 00:21:49.780
Hold it!

00:21:49.780 --> 00:21:52.120
I'm not afraid of you guys anymore!

00:21:52.120 --> 00:21:53.620
Don't mess with us!

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:59.790
Alarming! Alarming! Alarming!
See here! See here!

00:21:59.790 --> 00:22:03.670
I'm not sure what's going on,
but hey you, hold it!

00:22:04.800 --> 00:22:06.470
Hey, there's a fight out
in front of the school!

00:22:06.470 --> 00:22:09.590
--Love-love believe!
--Love-love believe!

00:22:27.150 --> 00:22:29.490
What's wrong, mister!?

00:22:29.490 --> 00:22:34.490
Hey, keep it together! Hey! Hey! Hey!!

00:22:35.620 --> 00:22:37.910
It's all DAIJO-BU DAIJO-BU

00:22:38.000 --> 00:22:40.710
When you sing this song, your worries will go

00:22:40.880 --> 00:22:42.840
Bye Bye Bye

00:22:43.170 --> 00:22:45.510
Cuz your heart will be carefree,

00:22:45.630 --> 00:22:47.420
and your body will be healthy,

00:22:47.550 --> 00:22:49.300
so resolve when to give up

00:22:49.470 --> 00:22:51.260
Bye Bye Bye Bye

00:22:51.300 --> 00:22:52.640
(Sing-ken-ken ken-ken)

00:22:52.640 --> 00:22:54.310
(Tidak apa-apa,
Nday kambay kambay)

00:22:54.470 --> 00:22:56.930
It's always the same old nonsense,

00:22:57.060 --> 00:22:59.390
U-MAI U-MAI U-MAI U-MAI U-MAI

00:22:59.440 --> 00:23:01.940
(Mm? Could be you're fairly dumb...)

00:23:01.980 --> 00:23:04.610
and then later comes the whimpering,

00:23:04.730 --> 00:23:07.150
KU-RAI KU-RAI KU-RAI KU-RAI KU-RAI

00:23:07.190 --> 00:23:09.910
(Ah... it's fine, it's fine, it's fine)

00:23:09.910 --> 00:23:12.200
It's all crazy over there,

00:23:12.370 --> 00:23:14.120
it's all "waah!" over here,

00:23:14.240 --> 00:23:17.290
and the whole Earth
is spinning the wrong way.

00:23:17.580 --> 00:23:21.290
So at this point now, yeah at this point now,

00:23:21.420 --> 00:23:25.590
you can laugh it away, excuse me, I must be going.

00:23:25.630 --> 00:23:27.510
DAIJO-BU DAIJO-BU

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:30.340
When you sing this song, your worries will go

00:23:30.470 --> 00:23:32.260
Bye Bye Bye

00:23:32.640 --> 00:23:35.100
Cuz you tried your MECHA-KUCHA best,

00:23:35.260 --> 00:23:37.020
to PECHA-KUCHA out a "Hi,"

00:23:37.140 --> 00:23:38.980
so just keep going unlike this!

00:23:39.100 --> 00:23:40.850
Wai Wai Wai Wai

00:23:40.980 --> 00:23:42.770
DAIJO-BU DAIJO-BU

00:23:42.900 --> 00:23:47.650
Once your lips touch, you can't change your mind.

00:23:48.070 --> 00:23:50.320
Cuz your heart will be carefree,

00:23:50.490 --> 00:23:52.240
and your body will be healthy,

00:23:52.410 --> 00:23:54.200
so resolve when to give up

00:23:54.320 --> 00:23:56.160
Bye Bye Bye Bye

00:23:57.830 --> 00:24:00.000
(Sing-ken-ken ken-ken,
Tidak apa-apa)

00:24:00.080 --> 00:24:02.000
(Gwaenchansseumnida,
kwenchanayo)

00:24:02.080 --> 00:24:03.380
(Mou man tail)

00:24:07.630 --> 00:24:10.630
Hoy! In Sana-chan's next adventures...

00:24:10.630 --> 00:24:12.630
I've got nationwide valentines!

00:24:12.630 --> 00:24:14.720
But then, there's one class that's
the most indifferent to Valentine's Day

00:24:14.720 --> 00:24:15.640
in all of Japan,

00:24:15.640 --> 00:24:18.640
and that's Jinbo Elementary, 6th Year,
3rd Class! That's the truth.

00:24:18.640 --> 00:24:21.350
Love just doesn't suit our class.

00:24:21.350 --> 00:24:23.650
Is this bunch capable of
celebrating Valentine's Day?

00:24:23.650 --> 00:24:25.650
Next time on Kodomo no Omocha,
Episode 45,

00:24:25.650 --> 00:24:29.320
the "this is the chocolate love and courage
that can change lives" saga,

00:24:29.320 --> 00:24:32.990
Mixed Feelings About Valentines

00:24:32.990 --> 00:24:34.490
Please use responsibly.

00:24:34.490 --> 00:24:36.320
Enjoy obligatory gift chocolate
in moderation.
